  "description": "The Movement 24 is the bike that many kids have been waiting for. A real “pro” dirtbike… just smaller! The heart is the lightweight alloy frame with oversized tubes. It’s designed to let you send, higher and faster than ever. The bike is packed with high-end parts,that include the new RST F1RST 24 fork with a 15mm thru axle and hydraulic rebound and compression adjustment, a lightweight SRAM X1 crankset with short arms and a hydraulic rear brake.\nMAIN FEATURES:\n- Tough and light alloy frame “Pro dirt” geometry\n- RST F1rst 24-15, 80mm travel, 15x100mm, Air spring, Hydrualic Rebound & Compression Adjust\n- NS Bikes aftermarket cockpit, adjusted to kids sizing\n- Rever Attack-U hydraulic rear disc brake\n- NS Bikes 15x100mm sealed bearings front hub\n- NS Bikes 135x10mm loose ball rear , hub with 10t driver\n- Light and strong wheels with 32 spokes\n- Microdrive drivetrain with small chainring\n- Sram SX 155mm 26t crankset\n- Kids specific grips\n- Tough and light alloy frame “Pro dirt” geometry\n- Rst F1rst 24-15, 80mm travel, 15x100mm, Air spring, Hydrualic Rebound & Compression Adjust\n- NS Bikes aftermarket cockpit\n- Lanxi Nutt hydraulic rear disc brake\n- NS Bikes 15x100mm sealed bearings front hub\n- NS Bikes 135x10mm loose ball rear , hub with 11t driver\n- light and strong wheels with 32 spokes\n- Microdrive drivetrain with small chainring\n- NS Bikes JR 140mm, 28t crankset\n- Kids specific grips",
